    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color breaker</strong> puts a vibrant spin on brick breaking with a color-matching mechanic that keeps you on your toes. Switch the ball\u2019s color in real time\u2014<strong>it must match a brick\u2019s color to destroy it</strong>. <strong>Stay sharp, react fast\u2014the fewer mistakes you make, the more you'll be rewarded.</strong> Clear over <strong>200 handcrafted levels</strong> across more than <strong>50 Circuits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Color-Switching Mechanic</strong><br>Instantly change your ball\u2019s color to match bricks before impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>200+ Levels</strong><br>Spread across 50+ Circuits with unique designs and escalating challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Special Bricks</strong><br>Bonus bricks give you an edge, while harmful ones shake things up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Challenges</strong><br>Tackle special levels with surprising twists.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color breaker</strong> puts a vibrant spin on brick breaking with a color-matching mechanic that keeps you on your toes. Switch the ball\u2019s color in real time\u2014<strong>it must match a brick\u2019s color to destroy it</strong>. <strong>Stay sharp, react fast\u2014the fewer mistakes you make, the more you'll be rewarded.</strong> Clear over <strong>200 handcrafted levels</strong> across more than <strong>50 Circuits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Color-Switching Mechanic</strong><br>Instantly change your ball\u2019s color to match bricks before impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>200+ Levels</strong><br>Spread across 50+ Circuits with unique designs and escalating challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Special Bricks</strong><br>Bonus bricks give you an edge, while harmful ones shake things up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Challenges</strong><br>Tackle special levels with surprising twists.</p>",
